    "description": {
      "content": "Specification of the Speechify Voice API (Text-to-Speech). The API synthesizes lifelike speech from plain text or SSML in 30+ languages, supports non-streaming and streaming audio, lists available voices, and creates and deletes instant voice clones. All requests authenticate with a Bearer API key.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Speechify Support",
